<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109936" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕψῐ</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on high, aloft,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕ. δ᾽ ἀναθρῴσκων πέτεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.140
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕ. βιβάς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				371
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς ἥμενος ὕ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.155
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.264
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴρηξ . . ἀηδόνα . . ὕ. μάλ᾽ ἐν
					νεφέεσσι φέρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					204
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμάχοντο . . ἀπὸ νηῶν ὕ.
				μελαινάων</span>
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβάντες</span> from <i>high on</i>
			the ships, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.387
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕ . . . ἀέλλη σκίδνατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.374
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕ . . . ὁρμίσσομεν</span>”
				<i>out at sea,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.77
				</span></i>
			. (Hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψίων, ὑψίτερος,
			ὕψιστος,</span>—all prob. connected with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρ.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
